--- !u!114 &-903163730827922863
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: '<b>Renderer:</b> <i>Render Mode: Stretched Billboard</i>, <i>Speed Scale</i> 0.06, so each drop is drawn as a streak in the direction it falls. Material <i>GS-Rain-Streak</i>: <i>Universal Render Pipeline/Particles/Lit</i>, Transparent, <i>Blend Mode: Additive</i>, alpha 0.4. Lit particles take the colour of the lights they pass through: the drops shine cyan under the canopy lights and warm near the kiosk.'
--- !u!114 &-619971476311410413
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "The rain is four <b>Particle Systems</b> (<i>GameObject \u203A Visual Effects \u203A Particle System</i>) under an empty <i>Rain</i> at y = 12, turned \u221225\xB0 like the station. They are four boxes around the canopy, so no drop starts above it and the space under the canopy stays dry."
